"""Forward to the shared control implementation in the desktop-server submodule."""
import os
from pathlib import Path
import sys

canonical = Path(__file__).resolve().parent.parent / "server-windows/scripts/usbanywhere-ctl"
if not canonical.is_file():
    print("Initialize the desktop-server submodule first: git submodule update --init server-windows", file=sys.stderr)
    sys.exit(2)
os.execv(sys.executable, [sys.executable, str(canonical), *sys.argv[1:]])
